| Feature | Benefit |
|---------|----------|
| **Data‑Driven Personalization** | Tailors learning paths to individual knowledge gaps in real time. |
| **Gamified Engagement** | Increases retention through interactive challenges, badges, and leaderboards. |
| **Real‑Time Feedback** | Enables immediate correction and reinforcement of concepts. |
| **Holistic Tracking** | Provides comprehensive visibility into financial growth across multiple dimensions. |
